{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>And into the ark you shall put the testimony.</b> I do not know why it is repeated, for it was already said ״וְנָתַתָּ אֶל הָאָרֹן אֵת הָעֵדֻת.״ But one may say: it comes to teach that while the ark stands alone, without the cover, he must first put the testimony into it and only afterward put the cover upon it. And so we find: when he erected the Tabernacle, it says ״וַיִּתֵּן אֶת הָעֵדֻת אֶל הָאָרֹן״ and only afterward ״וַיִּתֵּן אֶת הַכַּפֹּרֶת עַל הָאָרֹן מִלְמָעְלָה.״"], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:54:29.421835692Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}